WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
a woman who was declared dead at a hospital&nbsp;
in Ecuador was found alive and knocking on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:13.620
her coffin at her own wake I lifted up the coffin&nbsp;
and her heart was pounding and her left hand was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:19.380
hitting the coffin we called in 9-1-1 to bring&nbsp;
her here to the hospital emergency services&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.840
arrived at the scene and took the 76 year old to&nbsp;
the hospital according to the Ministry of Public&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.760
Health the woman was initially admitted for&nbsp;
a possible stroke and cardiopulmonary arrest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:36.120
a doctor declared the 76-year-old woman dead&nbsp;
after she didn't respond to the resuscitation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:41.820
protocol the Ministry of Public Health says&nbsp;
an investigation is now underway the woman's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:47.040
current condition is unknown and CNN's calls to&nbsp;
the hospital for comment have not been returned

